        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Make Money Playing Hockey!&quot;</strong><br>Add <u><strong>shooting</strong></u> elements to the intuitive feel of <u><strong>air hockey</strong></u>! Every time you smack the puck, coins jingle into your stash; when the match ends, spend what you earned to <u><strong>power up</strong></u> your paddle! With neon × pixel retro-future flair, jump into white-hot, spark-flying matches again and again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 1 hour. Perfect for a quick pick-up-and-play session!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Totally welcome! Upload/stream as you like. (The dev might pop in to watch!)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How It Plays</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match: Fast rallies—put pucks and projectiles into play and just keep shooting!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Results: Shows your <strong>money earned</strong> and the match’s <strong>heat level</strong>. You’ll get a 5-tier rating—aim for the top!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: Spend your coins to <strong>power up your paddle</strong> for the next match.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Stage Cap</strong>: Raise the upper stage limit by +1 (requires clearing the previous stage).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins Gained +1</strong>: Earn an extra coin per pickup (MAX +4).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Defense +20%</strong>: Increases effective defense when hit (MAX +100%).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Attack +20%</strong>: Raises base damage dealt (MAX +100%).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Play</strong>: CPU with 4 tiers (Lv1–3, ???).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Players</strong>: Local versus on a single keyboard.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Options</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skip Start Sequence</strong> for faster retries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Post-Clear Bonus</strong><br>There might be a little surprise...?<br><br><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Solo Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left: CPU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right: <strong>↑/↓</strong> Move, <strong>Shift</strong> Dash, <strong>P</strong> Shoot (hold to charge)<strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Two Players</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right: <strong>↑/↓</strong> Move, <strong>Shift</strong> Dash, <strong>P</strong> Shoot (hold to charge)<br>Keyboard only for now.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer &amp; Usage Policy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins in this game are <strong>in-game currency</strong> only and have no relation to real-world money or crypto assets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creator assumes no responsibility for any loss, damage, or impairment arising from the use of this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unauthorized redistribution or commercial use is prohibited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uploading gameplay videos and sharing derivative works are allowed within reasonable bounds; no prior approval or report is required.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credit</